\par\par \b \uc2 Japan govt buys back some foreign bonds from BOJ.   \b0\par\par\uc2 247 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Juni 2004\par 03:56\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2  TOKYO, June 8 (Reuters) - The Japanese government has bought back some of the foreign bond holdings it sold to the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  as a way to raise funds for yen-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  data showed on Tuesday.    \par \par \uc2  The outstanding balance of foreign bonds the BOJ is holding from the Finance Ministry's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  special account was 4.3474 trillion yen ($39.64 billion) as of May 31, down from 6.1489 trillion yen at the end of April.    \par \par \uc2  The ministry and BOJ agreed last December to set up a framework under which the government could sell its foreign bonds under repurchase agreements. The deal was set to end in March but was extended to the end of June.    \par \par \uc2  The ministry took the step as it had depleted its coffers used to fund its massive yen-selling aimed at slowing the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rise against the dollar.    \par \par \uc2  Tokyo sold a record 20 trillion yen in calendar 2003 and some 15 trillion yen in the first three months of this year, including a whopping seven trillion yen in January alone.    \par \par \uc2  The government normally borrows yen by issuing short-term government paper called financing bills to pay for \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .    \par \par \uc2  The Finance Ministry stopped \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  after March 16, its data shows. However, it raised its borrowing limit for \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to 140 trillion yen in the fiscal year that started in April. ($1=109.66 yen).    \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020040608e0680003t\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
