\par\par \b \uc2 DJ. Asia  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2 : Japan Stk Rise Drives Yen Up Vs Dlr, Euro -2-  \b0\par\par\uc2 340 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Mai 2004\par 22:04\par \uc2 OsterDowJones Commodity Wire\par \uc2 OSTDJ\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2004, Comtex News Network.  All Rights Reserved.  Standard Attribution Statement: News Provided by COMTEX.  \par \par \uc2 May 12, 2004 (ODC via COMTEX) --  \par \par \uc2 The Nikkei 225 extended gains toward the close, finishing up 2.3% at 11153.58. Meanwhile, data released by the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  showed Japan spent a hefty Y14.83 trillion in the January-March quarter to prevent the yen from rising sharply against the dollar. More importantly, the data showed \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  abruptly ended its \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  campaign on March 16, in line with many traders' expectations. Data released earlier in the month showed \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  didn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market in April. Many market players also believe no \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been carried out so far in May. Analysts say Wednesday's data strongly suggest U.S. criticism of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's heavy-handed \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was largely behind the MOF's decision to pull out of the market. Yasunari Ueno, chief market economist at Mizuho Securities, points out that the size of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  shrank notably after March 8, the day when U.S. Treasury Secretary John Snow obliquely criticized Japan's heavy yen-selling campaign. On March 8, Snow said relative value of \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  are best set through open and competitive \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets. He added that "no \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  can be considered strong if it is propped up on life support with \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ." "Snow also issued a warning against \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's yen-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on March 17, and the day before that was the last day the MOF acted in the market," Ueno said. On March 17, Snow said: "Nobody can devalue their way to prosperity."  \par \par \uc2 -By Leika Kihara, Dow Jones Newswires; 813-5255-2929; leika.kihara@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 -Edited by Alastair Gale  \par \par \uc2 The chart of late Tokyo \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates that accompanied Asia \b \highlight22\uc2 Forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been replaced with an enhanced \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  fixture that is updated hourly. Subscribers can find this table: -On Telerate pages 4046 and 1087. -On Dow Jones Newswires by searching the code N/IFX -On Reuters by entering FRX or INT -On Bloomberg by entering NI FRX  \par \par \uc2 Dokument OSTDJ00020040512e05c00364\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
