\par\par \b \uc2 SCHEDULE-Asia Business News at 0525 GMT.   \b0\par\par\uc2 715 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 April 2004\par 07:25\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     Editor: Anne Marie Roantree\par     Telephone: 65 6870 3852\par     All times GMT.\par     TOP STORIES:\par     TOKYO - Sony, others eye $5 bln bid for MGM - sources\par     MELBOURNE - Iron ore leads strong BHP Billiton production\par     TOKYO - Dollar bounce raises doubts on Japan \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  stance\par     BOMBAY - India's top drug maker tipped to eke out profit\par     - - - -\par     COMPANIES NEW YORK - Japan's Sony Corp and two U.S. buyout\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2  firms are in advanced talks to buy U.S. film studio    \par \par \uc2  Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer Inc. for about $5 billion, putting the    \par \par \uc2  owner of James Bond movies back in play on Wall Street, sources    \par \par \uc2  say. (MEDIA-MGM (EXCLUSIVE, UPDATE 4), moved at 0427, by Dane    \par \par \uc2  Hamilton, 890 words)    \par \par \uc2  MELBOURNE - Global miner BHP Billiton Ltd/Plc reports    \par \par \uc2  higher quarterly production for all its major minerals, with    \par \par \uc2  demand from China underpinning a 22 percent jump in iron ore    \par \par \uc2  output. (MINERALS-BHPBILLITON (UPDATE 2), moved at 0225, by    \par \par \uc2  Wendy Pugh, 550 words)    \par \par \uc2  TOKYO - Kao Corp, Japan's top household products maker, is    \par \par \uc2  set to post a sixth successive year of record profit thanks to    \par \par \uc2  strong sales of new products and overseas acquisitions, and    \par \par \uc2  likely to forecast another record-breaking year.    \par \par \uc2  (CHEMICALS-JAPAN-KAO (UPDATE 1), expect by 0700 GMT, by Yuka    \par \par \uc2  Obayashi, 450 words)    \par \par \uc2  BOMBAY - India's top drug maker, Ranbaxy Laboratories Ltd,    \par \par \uc2  is expected to eke out a quarterly profit as other drugs offset    \par \par \uc2  falling sales of its once-moneyspinning generic version of the    \par \par \uc2  antibiotic Ceftin drug. (HEALTH-INDIA-RANBAXY (UPDATE 1),    \par \par \uc2  expect by 0830, around 500 words)    \par \par \uc2  TOKYO - After a bumper year across the board for Japan's    \par \par \uc2  top five car makers, results for the just-ended business year    \par \par \uc2  are set to paint a scattered picture based on a more accurate    \par \par \uc2  reflection of fundamental strengths. (AUTOS-JAPAN-EARNINGS,    \par \par \uc2  moved at 0416, by Chang-Ran Kim, 800 words)    \par \par \uc2  TOKYO - Japan's long-suffering brokerages are set to report    \par \par \uc2  a steep rise in full-year earnings after the Nikkei average    \par \par \uc2  scored its biggest annual rise in three decades, but    \par \par \uc2  diversification strategies could detract from potential gains.    \par \par \uc2  (FINANCIAL-JAPAN-BROKERAGES, expect by 0700, by Miki Shimogori,    \par \par \uc2  900 words)    \par \par \uc2  TOKYO - Shares in Message Co Ltd, a Japanese firm offering    \par \par \uc2  care services for the elderly, are expected to make a healthy    \par \par \uc2  stock market debut, giving investors a way into a sector    \par \par \uc2  forecast to show strong growth in Japan.    \par \par \uc2  (MARKETS-JAPAN-JASDAQ-MESSAGE, expect by 0700, by Mariko    \par \par \uc2  Katsumura, 650 words)    \par \par \uc2  KOSHIGAYA, Japan - Organising elderly Japanese shopkeepers    \par \par \uc2  to battle the nation's big supermarkets for tofu sales might    \par \par \uc2  not sound like the business plan to excite the stock market.    \par \par \uc2  But a maverick retailer is doing just that, and investors seem    \par \par \uc2  to think he is on to something. (RETAIL-JAPAN-TOFU, moved at    \par \par \uc2  0202, by Risa Maeda, 940 words)    \par \par \uc2  SINGAPORE - Asian refining profits are climbing back to    \par \par \uc2  historic highs, driven by soaring demand in China, and refiners    \par \par \uc2  are ramping up crude runs to keep pace, analysts and trade    \par \par \uc2  sources say (ENERGY-ASIA-REFINING, expect by 0600, by Mia    \par \par \uc2  Shanley, about 650 words)    \par \par \uc2  - ~- --    \par \par \uc2  MARKETS/ECONOMY SINGAPORE - The dollar hits a five-month    \par \par \uc2  high against the euro, while Asian tech stocks chase gains in    \par \par \uc2  U.S. peers after soothing comments from the U.S. Fed chief    \par \par \uc2  clear the way for investors to focus on robust earnings.    \par \par \uc2  (MARKETS-GLOBAL (WRAPUP 2), expect by 0700, 700 words)    \par \par \uc2  TOKYO - Just as \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  takes its foot off the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2  pedal, the dollar has started to climb against the yen - in    \par \par \uc2  the very direction that trillions of yen of market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2  had failed to carry it. (MARKETS-\b \highlight22\uc2 JAPAN\b0 \highlight\uc2 -\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2 , moved at    \par \par \uc2  0429, by David McMahon, 769 words)    \par \par \uc2  BEIJING - Chinese Vice Premier Wu Yi makes another pledge    \par \par \uc2  to tackle piracy, but in a country where even milk formula is    \par \par \uc2  copied with disastrous results, analysts say officials face an    \par \par \uc2  uphill battle in the crackdown on fake goods.    \par \par \uc2  (TRADE-CHINA-PIRATES, expect by 0730, by Juliana Liu, 550    \par \par \uc2  words)    \par \par \uc2  BEIJING - The last time the Chinese economy overheated, in    \par \par \uc2  1993, economic supremo Zhu Rongji fired the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  chief    \par \par \uc2  and reportedly threatened to chop off the heads of unruly local    \par \par \uc2  officials. As the economy once again shows signs of a red    \par \par \uc2  lining, China's leaders have less dramatic and more complicated    \par \par \uc2  options at their disposal (ECONOMY-CHINA-GROWTH (ANALYSIS),    \par \par \uc2  expect by 0700, about 600 words).    \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020040422e04m000lq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
